                      "children": [
                        "किल्ले सिंधुदुर्ग"
                      ]
                    },
                    " "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-en"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " Recognizing the critical importance of a naval force, Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj ordered the construction of Sindhudurg off the coast of Malvan in 1664. It was built atop a small rocky island called Kurte to defend the Konkan coast from foreign navies and local pirates. "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-en"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " The fort’s walls, landing access and fresh-water wells show how a coastal stronghold could be supplied. Popular accounts give exact quantities of lead used in construction, but this figure needs a documented source before it can be stated as fact. "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-mr-text deva-body"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " स्वराज्याला मजबूत आरमाराची गरज ओळखून महाराजांनी १६६४ मध्ये मालवणच्या समुद्रात कुरटे नावाच्या बेटावर सिंधुदुर्ग किल्ल्याची उभारणी केली. कोकण किनारपट्टीचे संरक्षण हा यामागील प्रमुख उद्देश होता. "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-mr-text deva-body"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " तटबंदी, प्रवेशमार्ग आणि गोड्या पाण्याच्या विहिरी यांतून जलदुर्गातील पुरवठ्याची व्यवस्था समजते. बांधकामात वापरलेल्या शिशाच्या नेमक्या प्रमाणाचा दावा करण्यासाठी दस्तऐवजी पुरावा आवश्यक आहे. "
                  ]
                },
                " "
